### MediCitas — RF9–RF13 ciclo de la cita
### Requiere: docker compose up
### Sustituir ids por valores reales (pacientes / profesionales / servicios)

@host = http://localhost:8080
@kc = http://localhost:6767
@realm = medicitas
@client = api

### Token recepción norte
# @name tokenRecep
POST {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{client}}&username=recep-norte&password=recep123&grant_type=password

### Disponibilidad (elegir un espacio)
GET {{host}}/profesionales/{{profesionalId}}/disponibilidad?fecha=2026-11-16&servicioId={{servicioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}

### RF9 — Reservar
# @name reservar
POST {{host}}/citas?clinicaId=clinica-sur
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pacienteId": "{{pacienteId}}",
  "profesionalId": "{{profesionalId}}",
  "servicioId": "{{servicioId}}",
  "inicio": "2026-11-16T14:00:00-06:00"
}

### RF10 — Reprogramar
POST {{host}}/citas/{{reservar.response.body.cita.id}}/reprogramar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inicio": "2026-11-16T15:00:00-06:00"
}

### RF11 — Cancelar (otra cita)
POST {{host}}/citas/{{citaIdCancelar}}/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "motivo": "paciente no puede asistir"
}

### RF12 — Desenlace (cita ya iniciada; adm/recep o profesional propio)
# @name tokenProf
POST {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{client}}&username=dra-garcia&password={{$dotenv SEED_USER_PASSWORD}}&grant_type=password

POST {{host}}/citas/{{citaIdDesenlace}}/desenlace
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenProf.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "atendida"
}

### Profesional intentando reservar → 403
POST {{host}}/citas
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenProf.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pacienteId": "{{pacienteId}}",
  "profesionalId": "{{profesionalId}}",
  "servicioId": "{{servicioId}}",
  "inicio": "2026-11-16T16:00:00-06:00"
}
